From a820e8aca9892ddcb9c212a358486d40b5a655c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Murala S Swamy <ssmurala@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 21 Mar 2024 16:46:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-1173] fs1: bootrom: d2d link init in recovery

with this patch added support to d2d link
initialization during rom recovery, if any issue
with d2d init in rom recovery stage efuse bit
d2d_en can disable this init part. recovery
signal propagation from master to slaves is
not clear, hence kept open.

Change-Id: Ic4b14d0d93664ddb4a74fd4186e258686b20e217
---

